{"duh":[{"id":"duh","headword":"दुह्","headword_slp1":"duh","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"1. दुह् दुह् (originally दुघ्, cf. दुघ), ii. 2, and i. 4.\n I. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Par.\n 1","q":"Par.\n"},{"t":"txt","s":". To milk, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 8, 231","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":"; Bhāg. "},{"t":"cite","s":"P. 4, 17, 7","q":"P"},{"t":"txt","s":"; to milk out (with two accs.), 4, 18, 18.\n 2. To enjoy, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Ragh. 1, 26.\n 3","q":"Ragh"},{"t":"txt","s":". To practise from interested motives, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 3, 1165.\n 4","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". To draw something out of anything (with two accs.), "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 12, 3305","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":"; with acc. and abl., "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 1, 23","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n II. Ātm.\n 1. To yield milk or other desired objects, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 1, 6658","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":"; 6657 (also i. 4, Par., Bhāg. P. i, 14, 19). "},{"t":"cite","s":"Anomal. 3","q":"Anomal"},{"t":"txt","s":" pl. of the red. pf. दुदूहुस्, on account of the metre, Bhāg. "},{"t":"cite","s":"P. 5, 15, 9","q":"P"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. दुग्ध,\n 1. Milked. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Hariv. 79.\n 2","q":"Hariv"},{"t":"txt","s":". Impoverished, Daśak. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 192, 16.\n 3","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":". Collected, Bhāg. "},{"t":"cite","s":"P. 5, 14, 12","q":"P"},{"t":"txt","s":". n. Milk. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Bhartṛ. 2, 15","q":"Bhartṛ"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Comp.\n --Caus. दोहय,\n 1. To cause to yield milk or other desired objects, Bhāg. "},{"t":"cite","s":"P. 4, 18, 15.\n 2","q":"P"},{"t":"txt","s":". To produce, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 2, 77","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". Desider. दुधुक्ष, To wish to milk or to enjoy, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Bhartṛ. 2, 38","q":"Bhartṛ"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With the prep. निस् निस्,\n 1. To milk out, to produce, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 2, 76.\n 2","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". To withdraw, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Kathās. 16, 83","q":"Kathās"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With सम् सम्, To milk, to enjoy, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 12, 4384","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". (i. 4. Par.)\n --Cf. Goth. tiuhan; A.S. teon, teoge; O.H.G. ziuhan; Lat. duco; O.H.G. ziug (gaziug), zaugjan; τεῦχος."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"† 2. दुह् दुह्, i. 1, Par. To give pain."}]}]}],"duha":[{"id":"duha","headword":"दुह","headword_slp1":"duha","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"-दुह् + अ, adj. Yielding (cf. कामदुह).\n --Comp."}]}]}],"duhitf":[{"id":"duhitf","headword":"दुहितृ","headword_slp1":"duhitf","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"दुहितृ, i. e. दुह् + तृ, f. A daughter, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 2, 215","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". Anomal. acc. pl. दुहितरस्, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 3, 20, 28","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Abstract. त्व त्व, n. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 1, 44, 38","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Cf. θυγάτηρ; Goth. dauhtar; A.S. dohtor."}]}]}]}